  "description": "Key/value and collection storage over IndexedDB for Blazor WebAssembly, Server and MAUI Blazor Hybrid. Namespaced stores in one database, byte-level JSON transport that stays trim/AOT safe, atomic collection replace, and an in-memory fallback so a WebView without IndexedDB never breaks the app.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Kebechet.Blazor.IndexedDB",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-24T21:23:26.59Z",
